  full history retained, see `git log`

What upstream left open
-----------------------
The upstream README lists "Worker Support" (#14) under "Roadmap / Help Wanted",
and `IMPLEMENTATION.md` describes `src/workers/*` as "Currently unused". The two
files that existed there were non-functional stubs. This fork implements that
roadmap item and builds a workbench on top of it.

Files added by this fork
------------------------
All new files are MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 the CSG Forge authors.

  src/workers/protocol.js          wire protocol: brush descriptors, transfer
                                   lists, FNV-1a fingerprints, serialize /
                                   deserialize round trip
  src/workers/csg.worker.js        module worker: hosts the untouched upstream
                                   Evaluator, prefix-cache aware chain evaluation,
                                   plus CPU / solve probes for benchmarking
  src/workers/Pool.js              worker pool: task queue, per-worker state,
                                   abort signals, idle recycling, teardown
  src/workers/AsyncEvaluator.js    Promise-based counterpart to Evaluator with
                                   evaluateChain() prefix caching and a
                                   synchronous fallback when Worker is absent

  examples/workbench.html          workbench shell
  examples/workbench/workbench.css workbench chrome (dark industrial, amber accent)
  examples/workbench/main.js       wiring: document, history, UI, evaluation loop
  examples/workbench/graph.js      node model, primitives, presets, BrushStore, History
  examples/workbench/viewport.js   three.js scene, section plane, display modes, fps meter
  examples/workbench/exporter.js   glTF / STL / OBJ export
  examples/workbench/bench.js      main-thread vs worker benchmark harness

  tests/Workers.protocol.test.js   13 tests
  tests/Workers.Pool.test.js       10 tests
  tests/Workers.AsyncEvaluator.test.js 11 tests

  scripts/probe.mjs                smoke probe (DOM + canvas pixel stats)
  scripts/verify.mjs               full verification harness
  scripts/run-bench.mjs            benchmark runner, writes docs/shots/bench.json

  docs/shots/*                     verification screenshots and reports
  UPSTREAM.md                      change log against upstream
  README.md                        rewritten (upstream README preserved as
                                   README.upstream.md)

Files modified in upstream code
-------------------------------
  src/workers/AsyncEvaluator.js    replaced the stub with the implementation
  src/workers/Pool.js              replaced the stub with the implementation
  package.json                     added devDependencies: playwright-core, pngjs
                                   (verification harness only) and scripts:
                                   probe / verify / bench
  .gitignore                       ignores the local .npmrc registry override
  eslint.config.js                 ignores examples/bundle; lints *.mjs (the
                                   verification scripts); raises ecmaVersion to
                                   2022 so numeric separators and top-level await
                                   parse

Nothing under src/core, src/objects, src/materials, src/utils, src/libs was
touched. The upstream Evaluator runs unmodified inside the worker.

